{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Templar Order and forge your legend in Rise of The Templars , a multiplayer open-world co-op RPG set in an alternate medieval world inspired by Templar myths and Arthurian legends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living open world with friends, fight dangerous creatures, gather resources, craft gear, cook meals, raise companions, and uncover hidden lore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress your character by leveling up, unlocking new skills and spells, and prepare for small and medium PvE raids designed for 6\u20138 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our game\u00a0 can be played solo, but is built to shine as a shared adventure with others.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet other adventurers on large social servers, gather in taverns, and form raid or exploration parties before heading into the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/59c8d4c4bfe7d1af2e8a2118d6f8a680.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/59c8d4c4bfe7d1af2e8a2118d6f8a680.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Inspired by the legend of King Arthur and an alternate history of the Knights Templar, players embark on a thrilling journey to earn their own place among the Knights of the Round Table - and perhaps even uncover the most powerful secrets hidden deep within the Templar archives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/92436360b6b202913cc4b708fbed65ac.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/92436360b6b202913cc4b708fbed65ac.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Along the way, players earn rewards (i.e. gear, mounts or in game currency) by purchasing, renting, or securing resources as well as collaborating with landowners to acquire and build in-game real estate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/6d8df91640692c925660b4f88030b044.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/6d8df91640692c925660b4f88030b044.webp?t=1773136266 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is being actively developed alongside 500 veteran MMORPG players and offers an equal amount of fun for those who love multiplayer raid challenges and those who prefer single-player exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/ca24116486f4a5c48303ced252b595e3.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay options available in the current stage of development for Avalon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE across the genesis map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE multiplayer raids\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of multiplayer raids, currently limited to teams of six players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP on dragon mounts in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person and third-person gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel using either multiple ground mounts or the portal system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting, hunting, fishing, cooking, baking, and repair systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive world economy with mills, taverns, stables, and forges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple basic pets and attack pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Mounts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/411040731e6d7baf7e9d92a59b430680.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/411040731e6d7baf7e9d92a59b430680.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim your mansion in one of these seven exclusive harbors. Start your trade journey and watch your influence grow between islands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>The Round Table stands. Twelve knights serve it. And their king\u2026 is something far older than a man.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/0d91bcc45502729f6339633ae8a138cd.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise your dragon and soar above villages, bustling towns, seven harbors, and vast seas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/439c9ca77ca262883da8846c4deaef09.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Brave the depths of many dungeons filled with clever puzzles and daring jumps, offering endless adventures for all explorers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring friends. The vampires are hungry, the werewolves are restless, and the witch prefers her dinner served in groups.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mages and healers will love our two druid classes: Earth and Water Druids. Each has a unique skill set, making them powerful allies in raids and the quest for dragon eggs.\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.poster.avif?t=1773136266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.webm?t=1773136266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.mp4?t=1773136266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to raise the most coveted and powerful flying mounts: Fire, Ice, and Water Dragons! Players will nurture their dragons from eggs, watch them grow into loyal pets, and ultimately unleash them as formidable battle mounts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=430 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be able to freely move between kingdoms upon reaching level twenty or simply by owning homes, service providing buildings or portals in one of the kingdoms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The multiplayer raids are limited to six characters and will consist of following four classes:</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Ranged - Elves, Robin In The Hood </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Tanks - The Viking Clans , The Knights of King Arthur , The Brotherhood of Templars </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Healers - The Druids , Herne the Hunter </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Mages - Merlin- Earth, The Grand Inquisitor- Fire , The Templar Grand Master -Ice</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>6\u20138 player co-op raids with\u00a0 first-person, third-person, and far zoom out camera views - play the way you love in a truly immersive RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy true open world exploration, alone, with a friend, or with a companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In the lands of Avalon, there\u2019s something for everyone. Whether you're a lone traveler exploring vast horizons, a fearless leader in raids, a skilled weapon crafter, a keen hunter, or a fisherman and chef, Avalon welcomes you. And through it all, follow a rich quest line\u00a0 that guides you through the alternate history of the Knights Templar. All this and more awaits every adventurer\u2019s spirit in our world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/e7a30de6489ffaf75634fe419f4d327c.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/e7a30de6489ffaf75634fe419f4d327c.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wow, you made it all the way here! As a thank you, join us on Discord and claim your special community title.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281500?t=1773136266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773136266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/458765e99f41895234fee4c1fb1781ca1cb2318c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773136266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/458765e99f41895234fee4c1fb1781ca1cb2318c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773136266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Templar Order and forge your legend in Rise of The Templars , a multiplayer open-world co-op RPG set in an alternate medieval world inspired by Templar myths and Arthurian legends.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living open world with friends, fight dangerous creatures, gather resources, craft gear, cook meals, raise companions, and uncover hidden lore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress your character by leveling up, unlocking new skills and spells, and prepare for small and medium PvE raids designed for 6\u20138 players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our game\u00a0 can be played solo, but is built to shine as a shared adventure with others.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet other adventurers on large social servers, gather in taverns, and form raid or exploration parties before heading into the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/59c8d4c4bfe7d1af2e8a2118d6f8a680.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/59c8d4c4bfe7d1af2e8a2118d6f8a680.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Inspired by the legend of King Arthur and an alternate history of the Knights Templar, players embark on a thrilling journey to earn their own place among the Knights of the Round Table - and perhaps even uncover the most powerful secrets hidden deep within the Templar archives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/92436360b6b202913cc4b708fbed65ac.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/92436360b6b202913cc4b708fbed65ac.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Along the way, players earn rewards (i.e. gear, mounts or in game currency) by purchasing, renting, or securing resources as well as collaborating with landowners to acquire and build in-game real estate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/6d8df91640692c925660b4f88030b044.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/6d8df91640692c925660b4f88030b044.webp?t=1773136266 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is being actively developed alongside 500 veteran MMORPG players and offers an equal amount of fun for those who love multiplayer raid challenges and those who prefer single-player exploration.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/ca24116486f4a5c48303ced252b595e3.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay options available in the current stage of development for Avalon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE across the genesis map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVE multiplayer raids\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three types of multiplayer raids, currently limited to teams of six players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP on dragon mounts in the sky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person and third-person gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel using either multiple ground mounts or the portal system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting, hunting, fishing, cooking, baking, and repair systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive world economy with mills, taverns, stables, and forges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple basic pets and attack pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Mounts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/411040731e6d7baf7e9d92a59b430680.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/411040731e6d7baf7e9d92a59b430680.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claim your mansion in one of these seven exclusive harbors. Start your trade journey and watch your influence grow between islands.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/b82a6c73f0716d9b918c59fd9f8fe104.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>The Round Table stands. Twelve knights serve it. And their king\u2026 is something far older than a man.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/0d91bcc45502729f6339633ae8a138cd.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise your dragon and soar above villages, bustling towns, seven harbors, and vast seas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/439c9ca77ca262883da8846c4deaef09.avif?t=1773136266\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Brave the depths of many dungeons filled with clever puzzles and daring jumps, offering endless adventures for all explorers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring friends. The vampires are hungry, the werewolves are restless, and the witch prefers her dinner served in groups.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/7a8ba0f74d8309f9c767ee994d91f807.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mages and healers will love our two druid classes: Earth and Water Druids. Each has a unique skill set, making them powerful allies in raids and the quest for dragon eggs.\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.poster.avif?t=1773136266\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.webm?t=1773136266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/b7fd51aa8efe615540ac678ea1b95673.mp4?t=1773136266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to raise the most coveted and powerful flying mounts: Fire, Ice, and Water Dragons! Players will nurture their dragons from eggs, watch them grow into loyal pets, and ultimately unleash them as formidable battle mounts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/8c3b21b328c5c0fe241089456fefb4ef.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=430 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players will be able to freely move between kingdoms upon reaching level twenty or simply by owning homes, service providing buildings or portals in one of the kingdoms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/d5785010a49c9279ba0a57a365ba18e6.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The multiplayer raids are limited to six characters and will consist of following four classes:</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Ranged - Elves, Robin In The Hood </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Tanks - The Viking Clans , The Knights of King Arthur , The Brotherhood of Templars </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Healers - The Druids , Herne the Hunter </strong>  <br>   <br><strong>Mages - Merlin- Earth, The Grand Inquisitor- Fire , The Templar Grand Master -Ice</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/803bcc615736b56585336de006e69914.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>6\u20138 player co-op raids with\u00a0 first-person, third-person, and far zoom out camera views - play the way you love in a truly immersive RPG experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/4dc0ad76c0c8c84f29f9e4c5188f5c67.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy true open world exploration, alone, with a friend, or with a companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/152e269cc766bfdc236297c942e9c2cc.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>In the lands of Avalon, there\u2019s something for everyone. Whether you're a lone traveler exploring vast horizons, a fearless leader in raids, a skilled weapon crafter, a keen hunter, or a fisherman and chef, Avalon welcomes you. And through it all, follow a rich quest line\u00a0 that guides you through the alternate history of the Knights Templar. All this and more awaits every adventurer\u2019s spirit in our world.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras/e7a30de6489ffaf75634fe419f4d327c.avif?t=1773136266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/extras_big/e7a30de6489ffaf75634fe419f4d327c.avif?t=1773136266 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wow, you made it all the way here! As a thank you, join us on Discord and claim your special community title.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Danu Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281500/272ffc153287042a2ae62e7a4299a7dffb7edd2e/header.jpg?t=1773136266","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3281500/770063/8e38588964c4411c3c977e1fb36b84a1827c6e22/1750975639/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773072433","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3281500/770063/8e38588964c4411c3c977e1fb36b84a1827c6e22/1750975639/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773072433","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3281500/770063/8e38588964c4411c3c977e1fb36b84a1827c6e22/1750975639/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773072433","id":257063971,"name":"Showcase 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257063971/1dd8ebcd2fb5eca99ad52640923ebb05edd50f2c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773072433"}],"name":"Danu: Rise of the Templars","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae RTX 2070 8 GB or faster<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 7 2700<br></li><li>